  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2d9a2e2a224f7491",
      "translationZh": "大家好，audio.cpp 已合入多项性能改进。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "47af55203df5f5f9",
      "translationZh": "最大的亮点是 Higgs Audio TTS，现在运行时只需约 6 GB 显存，与之前的实现相比，峰值内存用量降低了 48%。感谢 https://github.com/mirek190",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6a80873cf1103c83",
      "translationZh": "我们还显著提升了一些模型的运行速度，尤其是在 GPU 上运行的 HTDemucs 和在 CPU 上运行的 PocketTTS。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d96e267ca905904f",
      "translationZh": "在结果一致性和正确性方面没有任何妥协。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0c75ad9f1e2a25d6",
      "translationZh": "以下是这些改进的汇总：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8b75289ce98b97d0",
      "translationZh": "模型 峰值内存降幅 加速倍数",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "52cfd7ec6cdc0f4f",
      "translationZh": "CUDA 为 1.06–1.08×，Vulkan 为 1.16–1.20×",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "7fd366679b323bac",
      "translationZh": "这些是运行时层面的优化，让现有模型在本地运行时更具实用性。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c55553f649f2fe6a",
      "translationZh": "WebUI 现已加入一项实验性的生成历史功能，让你可以重新查看之前的输出并恢复其设置。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0011",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ff7e4e17d0f65bd0",
      "translationZh": "audio.cpp 现已支持 110+ 个音频模型系列和 190+ 个变体（而且还在不断增加）！我们正在持续提升 CUDA、Vulkan、Metal、AMD/HIP 和 CPU 上的内存效率与推理速度。下一个版本将带来更多优化！",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0012",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "3c85b7e4be5751dc",
      "translationZh": "我们也在寻找贡献者，帮助改进 audio.cpp WebUI。如今已支持这么多模型和功能，我们很希望有人能帮忙，让界面更加精致、直观，用起来更加愉快。如果你对前端开发或 UI/UX 设计感兴趣，非常欢迎你参与贡献！",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0013",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c48704b4048d7677",
      "translationZh": "感谢所有贡献改进、测试构建版本和报告问题的人。很想知道这些改动在你的环境中表现如何！",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0014",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9e6ac730f074e381",
      "translationZh": "由 /u/Acceptable-Cycle4645 提交",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    }
  ],
